    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400180/extras/2667d65bdeb33a84f38f7bc0408eeb33.avif?t=1684169497\" /></div><br>Settling in for a vigorous and lengthy erotic game session you're suddenly whisked away to a fantasy world! Once you regain your bearings, awakened to a visual feast of boobies and butts of sexy monster girls spread out in front of you.<br><br>It is revealed that you have been summoned to this strange land for a purpose. Their village is trapped behind a barrier, and with no men inside there is no way to keep the village going. Until you arrived that is!<br><br>Rise to the call, become the Monster Girl Breeder and help these poor monster maidens repopulate their village?!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1400180/extras/0ede002f45debee9fb46667bc98cb8b8.avif?t=1684169497\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Translated version of the original Japanese Visual Novel<br></li><li>All the sexy monster girls are fully voiced with their original Japanese dialogue.<br></li><li>Original artwork HD upscaled with 16:9 and 4:3 variants.<br></li><li>Hours of &quot;plot&quot; to enjoy.<br></li><li>Audio including music and special effects.<br></li><li>Enhanced with character sprite animations.<br></li><li>Gallery and Scene selections.<br></li><li>18 sex scenes full of baby making goodness!</li></ul><br>Monster Girl Breeder is the English localization of a Visual Novel originally created by prolific Japanese developer Norn/Miel. We at Cherry Kiss aim to provide an authentic Japanese Visual Novel experience to gamers outside of Japan.<br><br>** PLEASE NOTE **<br>All characters described and visually represented in this game are over 18 years of age, and no actual, nor identifiable minor was used in the production of this game.",
